      "definition": "An alternative spelling of re-solve: to solve again.",
      "example": "The valid spelling resolve can also represent re-solve, meaning solve again; its /s/ reading differs from ordinary resolve with /z/.",
      "collocations": [
        "re-solve an equation",
        "solve again with new values"
      ],
      "distinctions": [
        "This is a valid alternative spelling, not a misspelling and not the ordinary solve-a-problem meaning alone. Re-solve refers to solving again; it must not inherit the ordinary resolve recording."
